sequenceDiagram
  actor U as Operator
  participant M as Mobile app
  participant A as API
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  participant B as BACtrack bridge

  U->>M: Select device and subject
  M->>A: POST /v1/test-sessions
  A->>D: Lock device and create session plus lease
  D-->>A: Session and lease
  A-->>M: Session contract
  M->>B: connect and start test
  B-->>M: countdown, blow, analyze, result events
  M->>M: Persist every event locally
  M->>A: POST /v1/test-sessions/id/complete
  A->>D: Insert reading, release lease, append audit event
  D-->>A: Committed once
  A-->>M: Reading and sync cursor
  M-->>U: Show immutable result

